OL,3,GNEWSA'We need more knee and hip
OL,4,Apatients for NHS operations'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS site set up to replace knees and
OL,7,Fhips has called for more patients to
OL,8,Fcome forward.
OL,10,FThe Hampshire Orthopaedic Centre (HOC)
OL,11,Fin Winchester said it has the capacity
OL,12,Fto more than double the number of
OL,13,Felective or planned operations it has
OL,14,Fperformed so far.
OL,16,FBased on the site of the Royal
OL,17,FHampshire County Hospital, the centre
OL,18,Fwants more referrals from across the
OL,19,Fcounty and the Isle of Wight.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
